ional penalty under that section.\n\n22. In this by-law, unless it is otherwise necessary to another meaning for the words\n\nThe word \"Chairman\" shall mean the person holding the office of Chairman of this Pradeshiya Sabha or the\n\nperson who performs the duties of the post,"
