ed on top of one\n\nanother without being thoroughly cleaned and the surfaces should be placed wherever possible;\n\n(vi) The containers should not be touched in such a way that the microorganisms can be transferred from the\n\nfood processor to the consumer with a spoon, knife, fork or any other container;"
