    "chunk_text": "THIS is to notify that I, Dhamma Dissanayake, Governor of the Sabaragamuwa Province has approved by the law Maintenance of Reception Halls withing authoritative area of in Kahawatta Pradeshiya Sabha, prepared by the Kahawaththa Pradeshiya Sabha by the virtue of powers vested in it under Section 122 read with section 126 of Pradeshiya Sabha Act, No. 15 of 1987 and passed at its general meeting held on 24.06.2019, by virtue of powers vested under section 123(1) of Pradeshiya Sabha Act, read with Section 2 of Provincial Council (Consequential Provisions) Act, No. 12 of 1989, and it will be effective within authoritative area of Kahawaththa Pradeshiya Sabha from the date this notification is published in the Gazette. DHAMMA DISSANAYAKE, Governor, Sabaragamuwa Province. At the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council, On this 30th day of October, 2019.\n\n1. This By-Law is enacted to regulate, administrate and regulate the functioning of Reception Halls within the Kahawaththa Pradeshiya Sabha Authoritative Area. 2. This by-law is known as the by-law for the Maintaining of Reception Halls in the Kahawaththa Pradeshiya Sabha Authoritative Area 3. (1) Any person within the purview of the Kahawaththa Pradeshiya Sabha Authoritative Area(Hereinafter referred to as the Pradeshiya Sabha) Do not maintain Reception Halls unless you have a license. 3. (2) Every person applying for a license under this by-law shall apply for a license under an application prepared in accordance with the first schedule hereof.\n\nphotograph\n\n30 A IV(A) \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.12.05 PART IV(A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.12.2019"
