lvent contamination and completed. 4.10 The windows should be easily cleaned and constructed to minimize the accumulation of dirt and they should also be equipped with removable and cleanable net through which the insects and flies unable to enter. 4.11 Adequate sanitary and drinking water facilities for the use of employees should have been provided as needed. 4.12 Platform with suitable material should be installed on the feet at least 45 cm from the ground so that it can be"
