    "chunk_text": "........................ Date: - Public Health Inspector -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- Secretary, I recommend issuing a license for the relevant place as per above application. (If not recommended, state the reason.)\n\n........................... Date: - Medical Officer of Health 12-677/5\n\nKAHAWATTA PRADESHIYA SABHA\n\nBy - Law Regarding Maintenance of Tea Coffe and Short Eat Shops\n\nBy-law on the Maintenance of Tea, Coffee and Short Eat Shops in Kahawaththa Pradeshiya Sabha Authoritative\n\nArea\n\n1. This By-Law is enacted to regulate, administer and standardize the operation of the Tea Coffee Shops, Short-selling Points within the Kahawaththa Pradeshiya Sabha Authoritative Area. 2. This by-law is known as the By-Law of the tea, coffee and short eat shops in Kahawaththa Pradeshiya Sabha Authoritative Area. 3.(1) If only any person has a valid license issued by the Chairman of any premises within the area of the Kahawaththa Pradeshiya Sabha (hereinafter referred to as the area shall run a coffee shop or a snack bar. 3.(2) Any person who wishes to obtain a license under this by-law shall submit to the Chairman an application prepared in summary form in the first schedule hereof.\n\n49A IV(A) \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.12.05 PART IV(A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.12.2019"
