ent.\n\nReducing the number of microorganisms in the environment by chemical agents or by physical means which\n\ndo not reduce the safety or appropriateness of food by \"disinfectants\".\n\n\"Drinking water\" shall mean water that is sufficiently free from contamination and bacterial and chemical"
