    "chunk_text": "72 A IV(\u0d85) \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.12.05 PART IV(A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.12.2019\n\nSecond Schedule\n\nPhotograph\n\nMedical Certificate issued to the worker in a Fish Stall\n\n....................... ............................ Date Medical Officer of Health. (Official Seal) 12-678/11\n\n____________________________________\n\nBALANGODA PRADESHIYA SABHA\n\nBy- Law regarding Maintenance of Beauty Centers\n\nTHIS is to notify that I, Dhamma Dissanayake, Governor of the Sabaragamuwa Province has approved the By-law regarding maintenance of Beauty Centers within authoritative area of Balangoda Pradeshiya Sabha, prepared by the Balangoda Pradeshiya Sabha by virtue of powers vested in it under Section 122 read with Section 126 of Pradeshiya Sabha Act, No. 15 of 1987 and passed at its General meeting held on 20.06.2019, by virtue of powers vested under Section 123(1) of Pradeshiya Sabha Act read with Section 2 of Provincial Council (Consequential Provisions) Act, No. 12 of 1989, and it will be effective within authoritative area of Balangoda Pradeshiya Sabha from the date this notification is published in the Gazette. DHAMMA DISSANAYAKE, Governor, Sabaragamuwa Province. At the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council, On this 30th day of October, 2019.\n\nBy-law on the Maintenance of Beauty Centers in the Authoritative Area Of Balangoda Pradeshiya Sabha\n\n1. This by-law is enacted to regulate, administer and regulate the maintenance of beauty centers in the authoritative area of Balangoda Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\n2. This by-law is known as the by-law of the Beauty Centers of the Balangoda Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\n3. (1) A beauty center unless there is a valid license issued by the Chairman of any premises within the area of Balangoda Pradeshiya Sabha (hereinafter referred to as the area). Should not be maintained."
  },
